    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s \u00fee man don m\u00e6ge, & lufige Godes riht Uton don eac georne, swa we gyt l\u00e6ran wylla\u00f0: utan beon a urum hlaforde holde & getrywe & \u00e6fre For\u00f0am eal \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00e6fre for rihthlafordhelde do\u00f0, eall we hit do\u00f0 us sylfum to mycelre \u00feearfe; for\u00feam And eac ah hlaforda gehwylc \u00fe\u00e6s formycle \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he his men rihtlice healde. And ealle Cristene men we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 swi\u00f0e georne, \u00fe\u00e6t hig inweardre heortan \u00e6fre God lufian & rihtne And we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc Cristen man geleornige, \u00fe\u00e6t he huru cunne rihtne geleafan & ariht understandan For\u00f0am mid \u00feam o\u00ferum sceal \u00e6lc Cristen mann hine to Gode gebiddan & mid \u00feam o\u00f0rum Crist sylf sang Pater noster \u00e6rest & \u00fe\u00e6t gebed his leorningccnihtum t\u00e6hte. And on \u00feam godcundan gebede syn VII gebedu; mid \u00feam se \u00f0e hit inweardlice gesing\u00f0, he ge\u00e6rnda\u00f0 Ac hu m\u00e6g \u00feone \u00e6fre \u00e6nig mann hine inweardlice to Gode gebiddan, butan he h\u00e6bbe inweardlice For\u00feam he nah \u00e6fter for\u00f0si\u00f0e Cristenra manna gemanan ne on gehalgedan lictune to restene, ne he Ne he ne by\u00f0 wel Cristen, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t geleornian nele, ne he nah mid rihte o\u00f0res mannes to onfonne \u00e6t And we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man wi\u00f0 healice synna & wi\u00f0 deoflice d\u00e6da scylde swy\u00fee georne on \u00e6ghwylcne And we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6",
